@startuml
title Grid Backtester - Current High-Level Component Architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam wrapWidth 220
skinparam maxMessageSize 180

actor "Authenticated User" as User

node "Browser / Static Frontend\nfiles:\ngrid-backtest-saas/frontend/static/index.html\ngrid-backtest-saas/frontend/static/app.js" as Frontend

package "grid-backtest-saas\nApplication Boundary (black box)" as SaaS {
  component "FastAPI Backend\nfiles:\nbackend/app/main.py\nbackend/app/api/v1/*.py" as API
  component "Backtest Service\nfile:\nbackend/app/services/backtest_service.py" as BacktestService
  component "Research Service\nfile:\nbackend/app/services/research_service.py" as ResearchService
  component "Celery Worker Path\nfiles:\nbackend/app/workers/celery_app.py\nbackend/app/workers/backtest_task.py" as Worker
  database "App Database\nSQLite local / PostgreSQL prod\nmodels:\nusers\nbacktest_runs\nresearch_jobs\nfile:\nbackend/app/db/models.py" as DB
  queue "Redis\nbroker/result backend\nconfigured by:\nGRID_CELERY_BROKER_URL\nGRID_CELERY_RESULT_BACKEND" as Redis
}

package "grid-backtest-core\nPure Python Library" as Core {
  component "BacktestEngine\nfile:\ngrid_backtest/engine.py" as Engine
  component "FastBacktestEngine / Numba Kernel\nfiles:\ngrid_backtest/engine_fast.py\ngrid_backtest/_numba_engine.py" as FastEngine
  component "Strategies\nSimpleGridStrategy\nDynamicGridStrategy\nfiles:\nstrategy/grid_simple.py\nstrategy/grid_dynamic.py" as Strategies
  component "Research Runner\nfiles:\nresearch/grid_search.py\nresearch/grid_search_fast.py" as Research
  component "Domain + Config + Results\nfiles:\nmodels.py\nconfig.py\nresults/*.py" as Domain
}

folder "Market Data Inputs\nlocal files under:\ngrid-backtest-saas/data/market_data\n\nExpected names:\n{SYMBOL}.parquet.gzip\n{SYMBOL}_{timeframe}.csv\n\nShape:\nDatetimeIndex + Open, High, Low, Close, Volume" as MarketData

folder "Generated Result Files\nlocal path from GRID_STORAGE_LOCAL_PATH\n(default ./data/results)\n\nSaaS MVP output:\n{run_id}.json\ncontains metrics, benchmark, equity_curve, trades\n\nCore optional repository outputs:\nsummary.json\ntrades.csv\nequity_curve.csv\nextra.json" as ResultFiles

artifact "Request Schemas\nGridConfigSchema\nResearchConfigSchema\nfiles:\nbackend/app/schemas/backtest.py\nbackend/app/schemas/research.py" as Schemas

User --> Frontend : use UI
Frontend --> API : REST /api/v1/auth\nREST /api/v1/backtest\nREST /api/v1/research\nJSON over HTTP

API --> Schemas : validates request/response payloads
API --> DB : create/list/update run records\nusers, backtest_runs, research_jobs
API --> BacktestService : MVP inline execute_backtest()\nGridConfigSchema JSON
API --> ResearchService : run_in_threadpool execute_research()\nResearchConfigSchema JSON

API ..> Worker : planned async dispatch\nrun_id + config_dict
Worker --> Redis : task state/result transport
Worker --> BacktestService : execute_backtest(run_id, config_dict)

BacktestService --> MarketData : read parquet/csv\nfilter date range\nresample timeframe
ResearchService --> MarketData : read parquet/csv\nfilter date range\nresample timeframe

BacktestService --> Engine : BacktestConfig\nStrategy instance\npandas OHLCV DataFrame
ResearchService --> Research : BacktestConfig\nstrategy_factory\nparam_grid\nOHLCV DataFrame
ResearchService --> FastEngine : fast grid search path\nNumba arrays/config

Engine --> Strategies : on_candle(AccountState, Candle)\nreturns EngineAction list
Engine --> Strategies : on_order_filled(OrderFilledEvent)\non_order_cancelled(OrderCancelledEvent)
Engine --> Domain : Candle, Order, Position,\nBacktestResult, metrics, config
Research --> Engine : repeated backtest runs

BacktestService --> ResultFiles : write {run_id}.json
BacktestService --> DB : persist summary metrics\nresult_storage_key
API --> ResultFiles : GET /backtest/{run_id}/details\nloads {run_id}.json

note right of Core
Core boundary rules:
- no web framework imports
- no database access
- no exchange SDKs
- accepts DataFrame, returns BacktestResult
- DataSource is protocol only
end note

note bottom of SaaS
Current MVP:
backtest endpoint runs inline.
Celery worker exists and calls the same service,
but API dispatch is not yet wired for production async.
end note

@enduml
